  # I Tested 12 AI Productivity Tools in 2026 - Only 5 Actually Saved Me Time
  
  ## AI Tool’s Your Boss Doesn’t Want You to Know About (Cuts Work Time in Half)
  
  [![Edward Foster](https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fill:32:32/1*crHV3Ho8YY6lW6l0x7vREQ.jpeg)](https://medium.com/@edward-foster23?source=post_page---byline--e69247b51513---------------------------------------)
  
