  [Superhuman](https://superhuman.com/)
  
  Superhuman is an AI productivity suite that helps professionals work faster and smarter across email, writing, docs, and context-aware tasks without constant context-switching. It brings together Superhuman Mail (a speed-focused email client with AI drafting, summaries, and automations), Grammarly-powered writing assistance, Coda’s collaborative workspace, and Superhuman Go, a proactive AI companion that offers help wherever you work: in your inbox, docs, or browser tabs. This suite is designed for teams and individuals who want to reduce busywork, respond faster, and focus on strategic work instead of repetitive tasks
  
  ### **Superhuman pros and cons**
  
