  - **AI across writing and communication:** AI assists with email drafting, summaries, rewrites, tone, and more in context rather than in a separate interface.
  - **Multiple productivity tools in one suite:** Includes AI writing (Grammarly), email speed tools (Mail), collaborative docs (Coda), and proactive AI help (Go).
  - **Faster email workflows:** Smart inbox organization, AI-suggested replies, reminders, and templates help reduce time spent in the inbox.
  - **Context-aware assistance:** Superhuman Go works across apps and tabs, offering suggestions without switching tools.
  
  **Cons**
  
  - **Feature scope varies by plan:** Some capabilities (like deep inbox AI and integrations) land only in higher tiers.
  - **Learning curve for power features:** Keyboard shortcuts, proactive AI agents, and multi-app context helpers may take time to master.
  
  ### **Superhuman best features**
  
  - **AI-assisted email drafting and summaries:** Quickly generate replies, condense threads, and stay on top of conversations.
  - **Superhuman Go:** A proactive AI assistant that understands your context and suggests next steps across apps.
  - **Integrated writing partner:** Grammarly-powered writing help right where you compose.
  - **Collaborative docs & workspaces:** Coda integration brings structured doc and project spaces into the suite.
  
  ### **Superhuman pricing**
  
  Superhuman offers **per-user pricing** with plans for individuals, teams, and organizations. AI assistance is included across plans, with deeper automation and controls on higher tiers.
  
  - **Free — $0:** Basic AI assistance across apps (Mail, Grammarly, Coda, Go).
  - **Pro — $12/user/month (billed annually):** Advanced AI writing, rewrites, tone control, plagiarism fixes, and branded publishing.
  - (~$30/user/month when billed monthly)
  - **Business — $33/user/month (billed annually):** AI-powered inbox triage, personalized AI responses, CRM context (HubSpot, Salesforce, Pipedrive), and team productivity features.
  - (~$40/user/month when billed monthly)
  - **Enterprise — Custom pricing:** SSO (SAML), advanced security and admin controls, analytics, data loss prevention, BYOK encryption, and dedicated support.
  
  ## Find the AI tools for productivity that fit how your team works
  
  The best AI productivity tools don’t try to do everything—they remove friction where work slows down most. Start by identifying your real bottleneck: scattered data, repetitive workflows, meeting overload, or inbox sprawl. Then choose tools that fit into your existing stack and move work forward, instead of adding another layer to manage.
  
