  ### **Leadership Is Aligned on Urgency, Not Measurement**
  
  26. **79% of leaders** agreed their company needs to adopt AI to stay competitive. ( [Microsoft Work Trend Index 2024](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/worklab/work-trend-index/ai-at-work-is-here-now-comes-the-hard-part#:~:text=79%25%20of%20leaders%20agree%20their%20company%20needs%20to%20adopt%20AI%20to%20stay%20competitive%2C%20but%2059%25%20worry%20about%20quantifying%20the%20productivity%20gains%20of%20AI.))
